# TURNIP TRUCK: the whole week can be done. From the title, the demo player
# presses real buttons through every newscast, all seven workdays (each
# chaos event once) and the screens between, to the ending: the Saucer and,
# with 50 or more deliveries, the Alien.
seed 7
game turnip
wait 30
botuntil state == 8 90000
expect won == 1
expect day == 7
expect week >= 50
expect cherry == 1
expect goals == 7
expect save_weeks == 1
expect save_best >= 6
expect tries >= 1
